{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-015",
    "title": "归墟盟约"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_082",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "陆照临写下父亲的姓名，顾长离写下顾氏旧债，叶观澜却迟迟不落笔。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "土堆下的敲击声没有继续。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2298,
          "end": 2298
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临和顾长离站在低地中央，谁也没有先动手。四周屋舍紧闭，墙缝里的青光却像水一样向这里汇聚。埋在土里的铜丝被雨水浸湿，偶尔闪出一点暗红。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2300,
          "end": 2300
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“挖开？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2302,
          "end": 2302
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“先看脚下。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2304,
          "end": 2304
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她用铜针沿土堆边缘划了一圈，针尖在北侧碰到硬物。拨开薄土后，露出一块半圆形石板。石板上刻着两盏并列的灯，第一盏灯芯完整，第二盏灯芯断裂，第三盏只剩轮廓。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2306,
          "end": 2306
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三盏灯？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2308,
          "end": 2308
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“或者三个人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2310,
          "end": 2310
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石板背面压着一枚铜片。铜片被火烧过，边缘卷曲，中央却留着一行细字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2312,
          "end": 2312
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第一盏照来路，第二盏照活人，第三盏照回不去的地方。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2314,
          "end": 2314
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把字念完，掌心残印突然发冷。低地四周的青光同时向石板聚拢，像有人在地下听见了他的声音。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2316,
          "end": 2316
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离用铜针抵住铜片：“别再念。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2318,
          "end": 2318
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是灯语。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2320,
          "end": 2320
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灯语也会叫醒东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2322,
          "end": 2322
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临将铜片收进布袋。就在这时，镇中传来一阵急促的脚步。白发老妇从巷口赶来，脸色比昨夜更苍白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2324,
          "end": 2324
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁让你们挖的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2326,
          "end": 2326
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它自己露出来的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2328,
          "end": 2328
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇看见石板上的三盏灯，拐杖险些脱手：“第二盏还在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2330,
          "end": 2330
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“什么意思？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2332,
          "end": 2332
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第一盏已经回山，第三盏没有回来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2334,
          "end": 2334
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想起玄霄宗西坡的灯，想起沈砚秋说陆沉舟送的不是灯，而是一段不能被点亮的路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2336,
          "end": 2336
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第二盏在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2338,
          "end": 2338
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇指向镇北：“在活人手里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2340,
          "end": 2340
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "镇北是一排废弃的仓房。仓门上没有锁，却挂着一串干枯的草结。陆照临走近时，草结自行散开，掉出一颗黑色种子。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2342,
          "end": 2342
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "仓房里坐着一个年轻男人。他的左眼蒙着白布，手里捧着一盏完整的引路灯。灯芯没有点燃，灯罩内却有温暖的金光。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2344,
          "end": 2344
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男人看见陆照临，第一句话是：“你记得自己从哪里来吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2346,
          "end": 2346
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2348,
          "end": 2348
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离问：“你是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2350,
          "end": 2350
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男人笑了一下：“规矩说，不要问名。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2352,
          "end": 2352
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那我们怎么称呼你？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2354,
          "end": 2354
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“叫我守灯人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2356,
          "end": 2356
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他把灯放在膝上。灯罩内的金光映出一段模糊影像：三个人站在雪地里，其中一个穿着玄霄宗旧式斗篷，肩上扛着灯杆；另一个佩着顾氏铜环；第三个人的脸被光遮住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2358,
          "end": 2358
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临靠近一步，影像中的斗篷人忽然转头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2360,
          "end": 2360
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“父亲？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2362,
          "end": 2362
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守灯人没有回答：“三年前，他们来到无灯镇，问有没有人见过一条不会熄灭的路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2364,
          "end": 2364
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你见过？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2366,
          "end": 2366
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我见过路，也见过路上的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2368,
          "end": 2368
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们去了哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2370,
          "end": 2370
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守灯人抬起蒙眼的脸：“你们只问去了哪里，不问他们为什么要走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2372,
          "end": 2372
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离说：“因为有人在追他们。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2374,
          "end": 2374
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2376,
          "end": 2376
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2378,
          "end": 2378
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守灯人摇头：“追他们的是忘记他们的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2380,
          "end": 2380
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "仓房外忽然传来一声空灯撞击。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2382,
          "end": 2382
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守灯人把完整的引路灯递给陆照临：“第二盏灯照活人。你若点亮它，镇上所有仍活着的人都会看见自己忘掉的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2384,
          "end": 2384
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“代价呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2386,
          "end": 2386
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你会先看见自己。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2388,
          "end": 2388
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有接。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2390,
          "end": 2390
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不点灯，它还能带路吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2392,
          "end": 2392
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“能。只是路会带你去它想去的地方。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2394,
          "end": 2394
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走到灯旁，指着灯座：“这不是无灯镇的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2396,
          "end": 2396
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前有人把它留在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2398,
          "end": 2398
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“姓顾的人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2400,
          "end": 2400
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守灯人沉默片刻：“她把铜环交给我，要我守住第二盏灯。她说若有一天顾家的人来，不要让她点灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2402,
          "end": 2402
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不该问名。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2406,
          "end": 2406
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临问：“区别是什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-090",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2661,
          "end": 2661
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗要你闭嘴。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-091",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2663,
          "end": 2663
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“归墟盟呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-092",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2665,
          "end": 2665
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“归墟盟要你开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-093",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2667,
          "end": 2667
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "风从雾中吹出，青铜门发出低沉的摩擦声。叶观澜向前一步，黑蜡印在地图背面泛起暗光。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-094",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2669,
          "end": 2669
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我们没有第三条路？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-095",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2671,
          "end": 2671
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三条路一直在门里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-096",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2673,
          "end": 2673
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临握紧半张拓痕，迈向雾中的青铜门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-097",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2675,
          "end": 2675
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门内没有光，只有回声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-098",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2677,
          "end": 2677
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "很近的回声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-099",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2679,
          "end": 2679
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "极近。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-100",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2681,
          "end": 2681
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟提出盟约时，先把一枚空白铜片放在桌上，要求三人各自写下不能交换的东西。陆照临写下父亲的姓名，顾长离写下顾氏旧债，叶观澜却迟迟不落笔。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-101",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2683,
          "end": 2683
        }
      }
    ],
